---
import Logo from './Logo.astro';
---

<footer class="footer">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="top">
      <Logo />
      <ul class="links">
        <li><a href="#">회사소개</a></li>
        <li><a href="#">이용약관</a></li>
        <li><a href="#"><strong>개인정보처리방침</strong></a></li>
        <li><a href="/support">고객지원</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <p class="info">
      (주)모두의인증 · 대표 홍길동 · 사업자등록번호 000-00-00000<br />
      서울특별시 OO구 OO로 00 · 고객센터 0000-0000 · help@example.com
    </p>
    <p class="copy">© 2026 MODU-IN. All rights reserved.</p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .footer {
    margin-top: 120px;
    padding: 48px 0 56px;
    background: var(--bg-soft);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--text-sub);
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .top {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .info {
    margin: 24px 0 8px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .copy {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-mute);
  }
</style>
